ood."},{"t":[252.5,253.3],"en":"Oh, my God."},{"t":[253.4,254.5],"en":"Sand is fish food?"},{"t":[254.8,255.3],"en":"No."},{"t":[255.4,256.5],"en":"It has not been legally proven"},{"t":[256.5,257.5],"en":"to be food of any kind."},{"t":[259.7,260.2],"en":"What?"},{"t":[260.7,261.5],"en":"You knew?"},{"t":[262.8,263.2],"en":"Wait."},{"t":[263.6,264.9],"en":"That's why you wanted to meet up,"},{"t":[265,266.3],"en":"so you could sell me this junk."},{"t":[267.2,268.5],"en":"Not to get back together."},{"t":[269,269.5],"en":"Yes."},{"t":[269.9,270.8],"en":"No, maybe."},{"t":[272.1,273.3],"en":"We can get back together."},{"t":[273.9,275.3],"en":"Carly, I love you."},{"t":[275.8,276],"en":"Ew."},{"t":[276.5,278.8],"en":"I never even considered it for one second."},{"t":[280.3,281.5],"en":"Freddy, are you okay?"},{"t":[284.4,285.7],"en":"If sand is fake,"},{"t":[285.9,288],"en":"then I stood up to Millicent all on my own."},{"t":[288.3,289.6],"en":"I really am brave,"},{"t":[289.8,291.4],"en":"so I can totally handle the fact"},{"t":[291.4,292.9],"en":"that I just quit my job"},{"t":[292.9,294.6],"en":"and spent all my money"},{"t":[294.6,295.7],"en":"and..."},{"t":[295.7,296.1],"en":"Oh, wow."},{"t":[296.3,296.5],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[296.6,297.4],"en":"Well, I'm sweating a lot."},{"t":[298,299.6],"en":"Probably just from the excitement"},{"t":[299.6,300.3],"en":"and bravery."},{"t":[301.2,301.9],"en":"What have I done?"},{"t":[303.1,303.9],"en":"You know what product"},{"t":[303.9,305.3],"en":"I can always rely on?"},{"t":[305.7,307.1],"en":"A can of whoop-ass."},{"t":[307.5,308.3],"en":"Scooter exit!"},{"t":[311.1,312.2],"en":"I can't believe it."},{"t":[313.2,314.9],"en":"I can see that you're hurting"},{"t":[314.9,316.4],"en":"and I feel you're..."},{"t":[316.4,317.2],"en":"No, dude, stop."},{"t":[317.6,318.8],"en":"Sensitivity sand is fake."},{"t":[319.5,319.9],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[320.9,322.5],"en":"Which means I've always been this sensitive."},{"t":[323,323.2],"en